Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.27,0:00:06.61,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,So, how is the princess going to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.13,0:00:13.06,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Two days from now, in the early morning, \Nwhile heading from Archen to Sanes Village,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:15.49,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,the princess's caravan gets\Nattacked by a hydra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:20.27,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The forests near Archen have always \Nbeen infested with monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:24.20,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,and Sanes Village was attacked \Nby a hydra a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:28.40,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The princess has come to Archen \Nupon learning of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:31.89,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,And next, she'll head to the \Nstill dangerous Sanes Village,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:34.31,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,only to be cut down on the way there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:39.39,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,People will say it's a tragedy \Ncaused by her goodwill and bad luck,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:45.47,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,but if you ask me, it's the natural\N outcome of her reckless actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.47,0:00:48.52,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,There was no funny business \Nbehind it, was there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.54,0:00:53.53,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Like an assassination made to look\N like the work of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.53,0:00:58.07,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Well, following the princess's death,\N there were all kinds of rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.44,0:01:03.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The most suspicion was cast upon \Nthe princess's half-brother, Prince Carenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:07.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,As a concubine's child, \Nhe's second in line for the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.78,0:01:10.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,He benefits the most from her death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.01,0:01:16.43,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,And even more suspiciously, \NPrince Carenas is in town right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.43,0:01:20.55,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Oh? But no one's talking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.14,0:01:24.08,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,He's a shut-in and won't make\N public appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:26.79,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,How very suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.79,0:01:32.32,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Well, I said there were rumors, but in the end,\N it was deemed an unfortunate accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.32,0:01:37.86,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,And now you're trying to use \Nthat unfortunate accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:45.08,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll gallantly show up to save\NZirgus's pride and joy when she's in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:48.52,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It'll make the perfect start\N to my heroic tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:56.47,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The key is making it look natural \Nwhen I rush in to rescue her,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:01:59.84,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,but I don't even know the exact\Nlocation of the hydra attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:02.55,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'll just have to keep an eye on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:07.85,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Man, I asked around \Nabout the princess's plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.85,0:02:09.81,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,but I didn't learn squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.47,0:02:12.48,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Why were you looking into that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.83,0:02:14.11,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.11,0:02:18.11,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,So she and I can have\Nour fated encounter, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.11,0:02:19.06,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.06,0:02:24.75,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,To make it happen, I'm going to gallantly\N swoop in when she's in danger, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:26.94,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.85,0:02:32.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Well... I just can't believe\N I had the same idea as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.17,0:02:34.12,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What?! You did?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:35.93,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Get in line!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:37.11,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:40.76,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Apparently, the princess really is in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:43.44,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,according to Sildonia's prophetic ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.44,0:02:44.46,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.46,0:02:45.52,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:48.85,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah. Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:51.72,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Okay! In other words, this is my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.72,0:02:54.78,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,So I'll have to follow the princess around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.78,0:02:56.73,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Good thing I'm great at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:01.05,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Keep your pants on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:48.73,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,They're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:52.39,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Is it really true that\Nthe princess is in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.39,0:04:54.20,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah, Sildonia's—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:55.89,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,It was a prophetic vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.89,0:04:58.48,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,An ability of yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.82,0:05:01.52,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,But how are we going to follow her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:03.90,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,We can't get too close, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.14,0:05:07.16,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,We shall use another one of my abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:11.43,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,W-Wait, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.96,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:17.29,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,She'll follow the carriage as a hawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.71,0:05:19.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,They'll never notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:22.31,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,My true form is the gemstone in the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:28.24,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,This body is an avatar made of magic power, \Nso it can be easily modified.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.83,0:05:29.72,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Plus...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:47.74,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I can even do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.85,0:05:50.93,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Ah, I've spotted the carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.41,0:05:55.62,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,She's being escorted by town guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.19,0:06:00.53,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'm sure they have some training,\Nbut we can't count on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.53,0:06:02.14,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,How incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.14,0:06:05.63,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Use it right, and this is even \Nmore powerful than a good weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.63,0:06:07.31,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Not to mention convenient!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.31,0:06:10.36,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous! You can peep all you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:11.51,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,On what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.89,0:06:13.84,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you spied on us in the bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:18.77,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Yeah, no. I tried to, but Kyle got in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.77,0:06:20.39,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You lowlife!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:24.44,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,So Urza's secret is still safe, thanks to Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:25.11,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:26.85,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You mean her heart-shaped birthmark?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.85,0:06:27.50,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.35,0:06:30.85,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You! How do you know about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.85,0:06:32.94,Main - Top,THERON,0,0,0,,So you {\i1}did{\i0} go to peep yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:34.49,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,N-No, wait! This is a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:36.95,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Something strange is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.18,0:06:39.46,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What is it? Is it monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:41.48,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,No. In fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.19,0:06:45.34,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,The drivers have stopped the horses \Nand attacked the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.72,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,That's not strange! That's nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.95,0:06:49.85,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Let's head there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.67,0:07:01.92,Default,DRIVER B,0,0,0,,Is it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.92,0:07:03.60,Default,DRIVER A,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:23.96,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Haste!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:37.59,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.59,0:07:40.45,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I've got a lot of questions for these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.27,0:07:45.48,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,The princess is alive!\NShe's just unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:48.51,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,These guys may have more friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.51,0:07:50.74,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Theron, stay with the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:03.86,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Hellhounds. Lots of them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.53,0:08:15.51,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.51,0:08:17.76,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,There are too many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:21.12,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Theron! Can you get the carriage moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.43,0:08:25.75,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,No. The reins have been cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:27.36,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,It'll take a while to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.25,0:08:44.15,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:46.29,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I knew it would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:52.37,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,It's approaching, just as you predicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:57.57,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Theron! Princess Milena's safety comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:08:58.59,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:01.63,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You two, stick with Theron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:03.18,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You're going to fight it alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:06.31,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I won't get reckless.\NI've got a shot at beating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:08.44,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I figure this is our best option.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:11.44,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:25.35,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Salamander!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.95,0:09:51.61,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,It's a little late to be asking,\Nbut you {\i1}can{\i0} fell a hydra, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.19,0:09:54.69,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Their strength is determined\Nby their number of heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:57.38,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I've beaten one with three heads before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.48,0:10:20.51,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Huh? Well, that's a lot more than three...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:42.70,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,What's the plan? Do we run?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.70,0:10:44.73,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.43,0:10:47.46,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You've got eight heads, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:51.63,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Even so... I've gotta do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:11:00.88,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,A hydra's moves are straightforward \Nand easy to read,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:05.10,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,but its tough scales make it \Npractically immune to sword attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.74,0:11:09.60,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,And most dangerous of all...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:12.73,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Its poison breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:38.59,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,However, this dragon leather\N armor nullifies the poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:45.35,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Blizzard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:01.36,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:34.81,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Very good. You're putting up\N a better fight than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.81,0:12:39.15,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I came prepared, you know? That said...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:47.42,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It regenerates like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:49.91,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,This thing's a tough opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.67,0:12:59.17,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! There's no end to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.17,0:13:00.77,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.77,0:13:03.11,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Can he really fight a hydra alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:05.18,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:08.35,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,We need to take care of these first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.39,0:13:14.81,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Damn, they sure are persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:32.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That was my last Blizzard stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:46.01,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Its regeneration is on another\Nlevel from a three-headed hydra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:51.36,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,There's no sign of it weakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:54.25,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'll have to strike at the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:56.39,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I can give {\i1}that{\i0} a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.43,0:13:59.31,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Haste!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:26.56,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:02.00,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Nice! It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:06.90,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I see. You shoved Explosion \Nstones into the wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:10.86,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Just throwing them against the hydra \Nwouldn't have done much damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:14.86,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Either way, that strike was quite powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:18.27,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. That move's all about speed and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:21.88,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It leaves me too vulnerable \Nto use much in real combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:27.08,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Anyway, this sure is a gruesome sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.58,0:15:29.79,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I know I'm the one who caused it, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:34.76,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,We're finally finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.76,0:15:35.91,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:38.16,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Kyle. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:38.77,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:44.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Are you two okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:46.02,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Kyle! You're all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:47.81,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You actually defeated the hydra alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.81,0:15:52.30,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It did give me a little trouble, \Nbut it was no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:53.67,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You reek!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.67,0:15:54.34,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:56.01,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,She's right! You do reek!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.01,0:15:56.99,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.99,0:15:58.29,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,You stink of hydra!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.29,0:16:00.68,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Stay away until you get that smell off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:02.50,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:09.79,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You were hoping for more praise, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:10.91,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.55,0:16:20.12,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,How's the princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:21.89,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,She hasn't woken up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.89,0:16:25.54,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Looks like she and her \Nladies-in-waiting were drugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:33.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We should probably \Ngive them antidote potions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:36.55,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Yeah. Buying some was a good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.07,0:16:43.62,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Kyle, I found this on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.62,0:16:45.40,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,It wasn't sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.40,0:16:50.57,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'd wager the two drivers lured the monsters \Nhere to attack the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:55.32,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,In other words, the princess's \Ndeath wasn't an accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.83,0:16:58.58,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,but an assassination made to look like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:20.37,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Send a squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.85,0:17:26.64,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.36,0:17:44.90,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Am I alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.84,0:17:48.67,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself too hard yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.82,0:17:55.07,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I thought I'd never wake up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.55,0:17:59.37,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,It would seem my luck hasn't run out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.17,0:18:02.67,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Are you the ones responsible for saving me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.67,0:18:04.56,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,It was me! I saved you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:14.41,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,My name is Kyle Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.72,0:18:19.34,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,While traveling, we happened to see you \Nunder attack by bandits and monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.65,0:18:21.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,so my friends and I saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.05,0:18:27.25,Default,ARKA,0,0,0,,Princess Milena!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.85,0:18:29.67,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,It's all right, Arka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.07,0:18:33.00,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,These people saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:37.82,Default,ARKA,0,0,0,,B-But we can't trust such strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.26,0:18:39.60,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:44.21,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,If not for you all, we would surely be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:48.99,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Er, Your Highness...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:51.21,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,The danger has passed, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:56.60,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It has, but... the situation outside is ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:57.73,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.73,0:19:00.05,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I must see it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.51,0:19:15.90,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,We're on the road from Archen \Nto Sanes, are we not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.36,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:20.92,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Are all the guards dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.25,0:19:24.47,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yes. By the time we got here, \Nthey were already slain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:29.19,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,She seems pretty different from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.19,0:19:30.27,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.22,0:19:32.23,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.77,0:19:35.66,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,A group of cavaliers is inbound from Archen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:44.12,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Princess Milena, part of the \Nking's guard is headed this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:47.51,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Oh no! We must flee this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.51,0:19:50.29,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,They won't just kill me, \Nbut all of you as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.82,0:19:55.55,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,No, I meant from {\i1}your{\i0} kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.55,0:19:57.53,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Won't they defend you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.53,0:20:00.28,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Defend me? Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.87,0:20:03.26,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,The man who wants me dead
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:06.16,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,is the captain of the second battalion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:08.24,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,His name is Zentos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:17.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Zentos? You mean {\i1}that{\i0} Zentos?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.55,0:20:22.52,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Arka, burn the bodies in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:28.49,Default,ARKA,0,0,0,,Neas farsokea zirknado...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.49,0:20:29.71,Default,ARKA,0,0,0,,Fireball!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.29,0:20:39.72,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,That man is after my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.17,0:20:44.27,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,With the corpses scorched, he won't \Nbe able to identify them right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.42,0:20:48.08,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,We must buy as much time as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.90,0:20:53.19,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Ninos, stay with me. Arka, you'll drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.96,0:20:56.76,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,We shall clear the area at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.76,0:20:58.36,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,You should get in as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.74,0:21:00.43,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I'll explain the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:18.09,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,If we're trying to buy time, \Nthe monsters will help slow them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs12\shad0\blur1\bord1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,142.615)}Next Time
